{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f9364915-fb30-8139-acc1-404b13705260",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:04:30-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan S. Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:37-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter Tavares. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:41-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello! Can you hear me all right? I'm Alan Hazard, and I'm calling for my mother. I'm told I talk loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:49-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, Mr. Hazard. What can I do for you and your mother?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:55-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She wants to vote early this time. She's got a trip coming up and won't be here on election day. What are the early voting dates?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:04-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Which election is she looking at? Is this the next one coming up here in the city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:11-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The next one, yes. Whatever's the next one on the calendar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:16-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. For the next election, early in-person voting, which Rhode Island calls mail ballot voting at the board, usually opens about twenty days before election day and runs up to the day before. I'd want to confirm the exact dates for the particular election before you plan around them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:33-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, say that again? Twenty days before what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:37-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About twenty days before election day. It starts then and goes until the day before the election."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:43-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty days before. Got it. Hold on, Ma, I'm on the phone. We've got the board game stopped here, Walter, it's all paused on the table while I call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:53-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:56-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the deadline? If she wants a mail ballot instead, when does she have to have the application in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:04-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The application for a mail ballot generally has to be received about twenty-one days before the election. After that she'd have to vote in person early, if she's still in town."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:15-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-one days. Is that for the application or for sending the ballot back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:20-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's for the application. The completed ballot has to be back by the time polls close on election day. Mail ballots also need to be properly witnessed or notarized, depending on what the form says."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:32-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Witnessed. Okay. [pause] Can you send the application to her? Or can I pick one up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:38-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can do either. We can mail one to her if you give me her name and the address where she's registered. Or you can come by City Hall and pick one up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:50-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll come by. It's easier, I'll be driving past anyway. Do I need her ID?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:56-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For picking up a blank application, no. When she fills it out, she'll need to follow the instructions on the form about identification."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:04-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, fine. Let me write that down. Twenty days for early voting, twenty-one for the application. That right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:11-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And if you want the exact calendar dates, call back or check the notice once the election is set, and we'll confirm them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:20-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's what I needed. Thank you, Walter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:24-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Hazard. Enjoy the rest of your game."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:28-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
